and Speaker in AlsaMixer are stuck at -8 percentage. Adjusting attempts 
immediately set max volume, still showing -8. Muting and unmuting work 
fine. PCM control is not affected. Realtek ALC283, vanilla 4.20.0 
kernel. Attaching codec info and amixer output. What other info should I 
post for debug?
